# The build's date and commit travel in XB- control fields rather than in the
# Version field, whose one job is telling apt which of two packages is newer.
# XB- is the Debian-sanctioned prefix for extra binary-package fields, and
# they survive into the apt Packages index because apt-ftparchive copies
# unknown fields through. Required by policies/packaging-and-release-model.md,
# "Identifying a build".
email-cli: unknown-field XB-Git-Commit
email-cli: unknown-field XB-Build-Date
